{"title":"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The first three terms of an arithmetic progression are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/e/bee5da6c832d0bf151666d8725b4e2f2e4d5629d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - 1, x + 1, 2x + 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"150\" height=\"16\" />, in the order shown. The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/3/1332d4badc0cb432da9b037bce4c4a377e3d335b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -2 \\qquad  \\textbf{(B)}\\ 0 \\qquad  \\textbf{(C)}\\ 2 \\qquad  \\textbf{(D)}\\ 4 \\qquad  \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{undetermined}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"464\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> represent the common difference between the terms. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/8/ec839c9862dead3f8a4057f1fdce6f0480f87733.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+1)-y=(x-1)\\implies y=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"259\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Substituting gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/0/010b478c72c46eae2a5b59d8134c22eeb3810236.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2x+3)-2=(x+1)\\implies 2x+1=x+1\\implies x=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"435\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/9/e790cd0f18ffd78e62e12077df381843fdeb4ed7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"54\" height=\"28\" />;\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME\" title=\"1962 AHSME\">1962 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1962 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1962\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>Problem 2</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1962 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1962_AHSME_P